{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"695cd78273e0ae8b7d4d8652df136647b8176716ed7279584f6bd047574676ff","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"罗马书","commonName":"罗马书","title":"罗马书","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"b9be5d35bd92cb6d348ea481a6fb73bef74a5861e18a9ef00c9b19772b6e8129","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/1.json","firstChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"ROM","chapter":1},"lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/16.json","lastChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"ROM","chapter":16},"totalNumberOfVerses":433},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["问安"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我对你们举荐我们的姊妹非比；她是坚革哩教会中的女执事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["请你们为主接待她，合乎圣徒的体统。她在何事上要你们帮助，你们就帮助她；因她素来帮助许多人，也帮助了我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["问百基拉和亚居拉安。他们在基督耶稣里与我同工，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["也为我的命将自己的颈项置之度外。不但我感谢他们，就是外邦的众教会也感谢他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["又问在他们家中的教会安。问我所亲爱的以拜尼土安；他在亚细亚是归基督初结的果子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["又问马利亚安；她为你们多受劳苦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["又问我亲属与我一同坐监的安多尼古和犹尼亚安；他们在使徒中是有名望的，也是比我先在基督里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["又问我在主里面所亲爱的暗伯利安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["又问在基督里与我们同工的耳巴奴，并我所亲爱的士大古安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又问在基督里经过试验的亚比利安。问亚利多布家里的人安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["又问我亲属希罗天安。问拿其数家在主里的人安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["又问为主劳苦的土非拿氏和土富撒氏安。问可亲爱为主多受劳苦的彼息氏安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["又问在主蒙拣选的鲁孚和他母亲安；他的母亲就是我的母亲。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["又问亚逊其土、弗勒干、黑米、八罗巴、黑马，并与他们在一处的弟兄们安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["又问非罗罗古和犹利亚，尼利亚和他姊妹，同阿林巴并与他们在一处的众圣徒安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["你们亲嘴问安，彼此务要圣洁。基督的众教会都问你们安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["弟兄们，那些离间你们、叫你们跌倒、背乎所学之道的人，我劝你们要留意躲避他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["因为这样的人不服事我们的主基督，只服事自己的肚腹，用花言巧语诱惑那些老实人的心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["你们的顺服已经传于众人，所以我为你们欢喜；但我愿意你们在善上聪明，在恶上愚拙。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["赐平安的 神快要将撒但践踏在你们脚下。愿我主耶稣基督的恩常和你们同在！"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["与我同工的提摩太，和我的亲属路求、耶孙、所西巴德，问你们安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["我这代笔写信的德提，在主里面问你们安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["那接待我、也接待全教会的该犹问你们安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["城内管银库的以拉都和兄弟括土问你们安。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["颂赞"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["惟有 神能照我所传的福音和所讲的耶稣基督，并照永古隐藏不言的奥秘，坚固你们的心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["这奥秘如今显明出来，而且按着永生 神的命，借众先知的书指示万国的民，使他们信服真道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["愿荣耀，因耶稣基督，归与独一全智的 神，直到永远。阿们！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/16.json","thisChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"ROM","chapter":16},"thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CO/1.json","nextChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"1CO","chapter":1},"nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/15.json","previousChapterReference":{"translationId":"cmn_cu1","book":"ROM","chapter":15},"previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"thisChapterAudioTimings":{},"nextChapterAudioTimings":{},"previousChapterAudioTimings":{},"numberOfVerses":27,"simpleChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/16.simple.json"}